    {
      "id": "p0061-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "For months, choice paralysis left Toby unsure of whom to hire. After considering all of his options and recommendations, he decided to hire 8-4, Ltd., a game localization company based in Japan.",
        "raw": "For months, choice paralysis left Toby unsure of whom to hire. After\nconsidering all of his options and recommendations, he decided to hire 8-4,\nLtd., a game localization company based in Japan.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.097332,
          0.09112857,
          0.67659192,
          0.14147143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09530107,
          0.09041429,
          0.7006279,
          0.14254286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "选择太多，Toby 几个月都拿不定主意该请谁。考虑过各种选项与推荐后，他决定委托设在日本的游戏本地化公司 8-4, Ltd.。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
