    {
      "id": "p0061-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because I'd previously done small jobs for 8-4, I already knew that everyone there loved Undertale and that they hoped to see it released in Japan someday. So although I wasn't involved with Undertale's localization at first, I watched as Toby and 8-4 got things rolling in early 2016.",
        "raw": "Because I'd previously done small jobs for 8-4, I already knew that everyone\nthere loved Underta/e and that they hoped to see it released in Japan someday.\nSo although I wasn't involved with Underta/e's localization at first, I watched\nas Toby and 8-4 got things rolling in early 2016.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09735231,
          0.15527143,
          0.69859698,
          0.22317857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09530107,
          0.15455714,
          0.7006279,
          0.22425
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          5,
          6,
          7,
          8
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "我之前为 8-4 做过几项小工作，早已知道他们都喜欢 Undertale，也希望有一天它能在日本发行。所以，虽然最初我没参与本地化，却在一旁看着 Toby 和 8-4 于2016年初开始行动。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
