      "id": "p0061-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Tokyo-based 8-4, Ltd. was founded in 2005 to fill the growing need for video game localization specialists. Today, 8-4 is known for localizing entries in popular Japanese series into English, including NieR, Monster Hunter, Dragon Quest, Katamari, and Tales.",
